amera:"Use Camera",uploadReceipt:"Upload Receipt",processingVision:"Processing Neural Vision...",expenseSubmission:"Expense Submission",paymentMethod:"Payment Method",allCategories:"All Categories",allDepartments:"All Departments",filterByDate:"Filter by Date",addExpense:"Add New Expense",editExpense:"Edit Expense",viewReceipt:"View Receipt",noReceipt:"No Receipt Attached",confirmDelete:"Are you sure you want to delete this?",rapidNavigation:"Rapid Navigation",goToDashboard:"Go to Dashboard",searchMembers:"Search Members",fiscalPlanning:"Fiscal Planning",fundAccounting:"Fund Accounting",trialEnding:"Trial ending in",days:"days",day:"day",upgradeNow:"Upgrade Now",renewsIn:"Renews in",activeTrial:"Active Trial",remaining:"remaining",seePlans:"See Plans",header_profile:"Profile",header_preferences:"Preferences",header_signout:"Sign Out",header_notifications:"Notifications",header_no_notifications:"No new notifications",loadingWorkspace:"Loading your workspace...",congregation:"Congregation",activeMembers:"Active Members",addMember:"Add Member",editMember:"Edit Member",sendStatement:"Send Statement",viewStatement:"View Statement",joined:"Joined",role:"Role",volunteer:"Volunteer",deacon:"Deacon",financialOverview:"Financial Overview",revenueVsExpenses:"Revenue vs Expenses",newTransaction:"New Transaction",exportPDF:"Export PDF",recentTransactions:"Recent Transactions",financialHealth:"Financial Health",quickAccess:"Quick Access",missionMatrixDesc:"Real-time fund progression",latestLedgerActivity:"Latest ledger activity",keyPerformanceIndicators:"Key Performance Indicators",budgetUtilization:"Budget Utilization",withinTarget:"Within target",nearLimit:"Near limit",secureEncrypted:"Secure & Encrypted",dataProtected:"All data protected",analyticsTitle:"Financial Analytics",analyticsDesc:"YTD/MTD metrics, revenue trends, and expense breakdowns.",memberMgmtTitle:"Member Management",memberMgmtDesc:"Secure database with full giving history and insights.",expenseWorkflowTitle:"Expense Workflow",expenseWorkflowDesc:"Categorized expense tracking with multi-level approvals.",smartGivingDesc:"Online giving, pledge tracking, and donor analytics.",payrollStaffTitle:"Payroll & Staff",payrollStaffDesc:"Automated payroll with tax calculations and compliance.",budgetPlanningDesc:"Annual budget allocation by department and fund.",troubleSigningIn:"Trouble signing in?",legalTermsTitle:"Terms of Service",legalPrivacyTitle:"Privacy & Security Policy",legalLastUpdated:"Last updated",legalTerms_title1:"1. Comprehensive Service Scope & Ecclesiastical Use",legalTerms_content1:"Storehouse Finance provides a specialized, cloud-based financial operating system specifically engineered for the stewardship needs of ecclesiastical organizations. By accessing and utilizing our platform, you acknowledge and agree that you are representing an authorized church entity and will provide accurate, verifiable financial records. Our services include fund accounting, payroll automation, and strategic budgeting tools designed to facilitate transparent and efficient financial management within your sanctuary.",legalTerms_title2:"2. Account Stewardship & Multi-Admin Security Protocols",legalTerms_content2:"Primary administrators and designated church financial officers are solely responsible for maintaining the absolute confidentiality of their account credentials, including passwords and 2FA tokens. You agree to immediately notify Storehouse Finance of any unauthorized access or security breach. Your church is responsible for all activities that occur within its workspace, and must ensure that only authorized personnel have access to sensitive financial ledgers and member contribution data.",legalTerms_title3:"3. Data Sovereignty & Perpetual Stewardship Rights",legalTerms_content3:"As the authorized user, your ecclesiastical organization retains full, perpetual sovereignty and ownership over all uploaded financial data and member records. Storehouse Finance acts exclusively as a secure steward of this data, providing bank-grade synchronization, redundant backup systems, and proprietary reporting tools. We will not use your church’s data for any purpose other than providing the agreed-upon services, and you maintain the right to export your entire ledger in standard formats at any time.",legalTerms_title4:"4. Regulatory Compliance & Temporal Financial Law",legalTerms_content4:"Users are strictly responsible for ensuring their use of the platform aligns with all relevant local, regional, and national tax laws, including 501(c)(3) tax-exempt status requirements in the United States and similar charitable governance frameworks worldwide. Storehouse Finance provides the tools for compliance, but the ultimate responsibility for accurate tax filing, minister compensation reporting, and ecclesiastical financial governance rests with the church administration and its designated officials.",legalPrivacy_title1:"1. Financial Data Integrity & 256-Bit Encryption",legalPrivacy_content1:"We utilize state-of-the-art 256-bit bank-grade encryption protocols for the transmission and storage of all financial records. Your church’s tithes, offerings, restricted funds, and payroll disbursements are protected by advanced cryptographic shields. We guarantee that your financial data will never be sold, leased, or shared with third-party advertisers or unauthorized entities, ensuring that the sacred trust between your congregation and its finances remains unbroken.",legalPrivacy_title2:"2. Member Personal Privacy & Confidential Ministry Use",legalPrivacy_content2:'Member profiles, including names, contact details, and specific giving histories, are treated as highly confidential ecclesiastical records. This data is utilized solely for the church’s internal ministry purposes, such as generating tax-compliant contribution statements and facilitating pastoral care. We strictly adhere to "Privacy by Design" principles, ensuring that sensitive member information is only accessible to staff members with specifically authorized permissions within your vault.',legalPrivacy_title3:"3. Redundant Cloud Storage & Strategic Sync Reliability",legalPrivacy_content3:"Your congregation’s data is housed in geographically redundant, top-tier data centers that feature 24/7 physical security and multi-layered digital defenses. We maintain comprehensive, unalterable audit logs of all platform access and administrative actions to ensure the integrity of your sanctuary’s stewardship. Our systems are built for 99.9% uptime, ensuring that your financial officers always have access to the real-time financial health of your organization.",legalPrivacy_title4:"4. Transparency & Right to Portability",legalPrivacy_content4:"We believe in absolute transparency regarding how your data is handled. You have the right to request a full audit of your organization’s data usage at any time. Furthermore, we support the right to data portability; your church can generate and download complete financial summaries and member rosters in spreadsheet or PDF formats whenever necessary. We are committed to being a transparent partner in your ecclesiastical mission and financial stewardship.",legalUnderstand:"I Understand",resetInstructions:"Enter your email and we will send you a link to reset your password.",sendResetLink:"Send Reset Link",sendResetLinkAction:"Send Reset Link",sending:"Sending...",backToSignIn:"Back to Sign In",forgotPassword:"Forgot password?",secureYourAccount:"Secure Your Account",enterNewPasswordDesc:"Please enter a strong new password to regain access to your dashboard.",newPassword:"New Password",confirmNewPassword:"Confirm New Password",savePassword:"Save Password",updating:"Updating...",passwordSuccess:"Password Updated!",redirectingToDashboard:"Your security credentials have been synchronized. Redirecting you to the sanctuary dashboard...",almostThere:"Almost there!",resetPassword:"Reset Password",passwordsMatch:"Passwords match",passwordsDoNot